# Hanita no longer uses any API key inside the app.
# Gemini is called through Firebase AI Logic and protected by Firebase App Check,
# so NO secret should ever be placed in this file, in BuildConfig or in the APK.
#
# Release signing is read from environment variables only:
# KEYSTORE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/upload-keystore.jks
# STORE_PASSWORD=...
# KEY_ALIAS=upload
# KEY_PASSWORD=...
